### Fluency Lab — Practice / Phrases endpoints
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api

### Listar todas as frases
# @name allPhrases
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice/phrases.php

### Filtrar por categoria
# @name phrasesByCategory
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice/phrases.php?category=Trabalho

### Filtrar por dificuldade
# @name phrasesByDifficulty
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice/phrases.php?difficulty=easy

### Filtrar por categoria + dificuldade
# @name phrasesFiltered
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice/phrases.php?category=Trabalho&difficulty=easy
